{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IOJeOM7FEU1793143442.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>投資產品交易平台Robinhood第三季度業績僅符合市場預期，股價在延長交易時段，曾跌超過半成。</p><p></p><p>公司季內純利4.68億美元，按年跌一成六。每股攤薄盈利51美仙，同樣跌一成六。期內收入逾14億美元，增長一成二。當中來自交易相關收入8.67億美元，增長一成九，但少於市場預期的8.79億美元。淨利息收入減少百分之9，其他收入則增長六成一。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:21:01.604389+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T23:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:58:25.024872+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:18:15.372766+00:00","content_hash":"52fdd4fe3538d3d14accdf17ced04de965fb4751682d5fbdbb43401b7ee253a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:21:01.604389+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}